      "text": "1",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have. $n \\sqrt{2}-1    < [n \\sqrt{2]} \\leq n \\sqrt{2} \\quad[\\because x-1 \\leq[x] \\leq x]$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad \\sqrt{2}-\\frac{1}{n} < [n \\sqrt{2}] \\leq 1$\r\n$\\therefore$ By Sandwich theorem. $\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{2}-\\frac{1}{n}\\right)=\\sqrt{2}$",
    "image": null
